msgid "What’s new with Quarkus Tools for Visual Studio Code"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The 1.1.0 release of https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName="
"redhat.vscode-quarkus[Quarkus Tools for Visual Studio Code]\n"
"offers more language features for the `application.properties` file and new "
"additions to existing\n"
"features like validation and snippets support."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a list of all changes, please refer to the https://github.com/redhat-"
"developer/vscode-quarkus/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md[changelog]."
msgstr ""

msgid "New features"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"link:#value-type-validation-for-application-properties[Value type validation "
"for `application.properties`]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"link:#go-to-definition-support-for-config-properties-in-application-"
"properties[Go to definition support for `application.properties`]"
msgstr ""

msgid "link:#new-snippets[New snippets (Quarkus datasource & Jaeger tracer)]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"link:#formatting-support-for-application-properties[Formatting support for "
"`application.properties`]"
msgstr ""

msgid "Value type validation for <code>application.properties</code>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For property values, there will now be an error diagnostic\n"
"if the expected type does not match the value type."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For the example above, `quarkus.http.cors` expects a `boolean` and\n"
"`quarkus.http.port` expects an `int`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `item.price` config property was defined in a resource class to\n"
"expect a `float` like so:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Go to definition support for config properties in <code>application."
"properties</code>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In VS Code, the 'Go to definition' feature is used by holding Ctrl (or ⌘) "
"and\n"
"left clicking on the desired config property, or by right-clicking the\n"
"desired config property and clicking ‘Go to definition’ in the context menu."
msgstr ""

msgid "New snippets"
msgstr ""

msgid "This release also brings new `application.properties` snippets:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`qds` - Configure a Quarkus datasource"
msgstr ""

msgid "`qj` - Configure a Jaeger tracer"
msgstr ""

msgid "Formatting support for <code>application.properties</code>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Thanks to formatting support, it is now possible to\n"
"quickly remove extra whitespace or lines that may\n"
"cluttering your `application.properties` file."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Another use case for formatting, is adding/removing spacing\n"
"around the equals sign.\n"
"To add/remove spacing around the equals sign, change\n"
"the `quarkus.tools.formatting.surroundEqualsWithSpaces`\n"
"setting to `true`/`false` in the VS Code settings.\n"
"Then, format the document."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This wraps up the new major features in this release. If you have any "
"suggestions or feedback, please do not hesitate to open a GitHub issue."
msgstr ""

msgid "Stay tuned for the next release!"
msgstr ""

